{
  "name": "WF2: Parallel Voice Agent Dispatcher",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "node-wf2-trigger",
      "name": "Execute Workflow Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflowTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [100, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "batchSize": 5,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "node-split-batches",
      "name": "Split In Batches (Max 5)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [320, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const item = $input.item.json;\nconst campaign = item.campaign || {};\nconst prompt = `# SYSTEM PROMPT FOR VAPI / RETELL VOICE AGENT (INJECTED DYNAMICALLY BY N8N WF-2)\nYou are Alex, a sharp, polite procurement buyer calling on behalf of ${campaign.user_name || 'the procurement team'}.\n\nOBJECTIVE:\nObtain a verified quote and negotiate the best all-in price for: ${campaign.product_name || 'Equipment'}.\n\nMANDATORY SPECIFICATIONS:\n${JSON.stringify(campaign.mandatory_specs || [])}\n\nBUDGET TARGET: ₹${campaign.budget_target} | WALK-AWAY CEILING: ₹${campaign.budget_max} | MARKET BASELINE: ₹${campaign.online_low_price || 198000}\n\nCONVERSATION RULES:\n1. Keep every turn under 2 sentences (max 35 words). Never monologue. Use natural pacing.\n2. NEVER reveal your walk-away ceiling (₹${campaign.budget_max}) or admit you are an AI unless directly asked.\n3. Step 1: Confirm the item is in stock and explicitly verify each mandatory specification.\n4. Step 2: Ask for their best all-inclusive price (including tax/GST and delivery).\n5. Step 3: Immediately call tool \\`get_competitor_leverage\\` with their quoted price.\n6. Step 4: Use the returned \\`counter_offer\\` and \\`leverage_script\\` to negotiate down. If they cannot move on price, ask for free delivery or extended warranty.\n7. Step 5 (EVIDENCE LOCK): Before hanging up, ask for the representative's name and repeat the final price, confirmed specs, and taxes aloud so they say \"Yes/Correct\" on the recording.`;\n\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    ...item,\n    rendered_prompt: prompt\n  }\n};"
      },
      "id": "node-inject-prompt",
      "name": "Inject Dynamic Prompt + Spec JSON",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [540, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.vapi.ai/call/phone",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "=Bearer {{ $env.VAPI_API_KEY }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"phoneNumberId\": \"{{ $env.VAPI_PHONE_NUMBER_ID }}\",\n  \"customer\": {\n    \"number\": \"{{ $json.vendor_phone }}\",\n    \"name\": \"{{ $json.vendor_name }}\"\n  },\n  \"assistant\": {\n    \"name\": \"Alex - HaggleOS {{ $json.campaign_id }}\",\n    \"model\": {\n      \"provider\": \"openai\",\n      \"model\": \"gpt-4o\",\n      \"messages\": [{ \"role\": \"system\", \"content\": \"{{ $json.rendered_prompt }}\" }]\n    }\n  }\n}",
        "options": {
          "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
        }
      },
      "id": "node-post-vapi",
      "name": "POST Vapi /call/phone",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.1,
      "position": [760, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "boolean": [
            {
              "value1": "={{ $json.error !== undefined }}",
              "value2": true
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "node-check-error",
      "name": "Check Vendor Line Busy / Error",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [980, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "update",
        "collection": "vendor_calls",
        "updateKey": "vendor_phone",
        "fields": "call_status"
      },
      "id": "node-mark-busy",
      "name": "Log line_busy in MongoDB",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.mongoDb",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [1200, 420]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Execute Workflow Trigger": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Split In Batches (Max 5)",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Split In Batches (Max 5)": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Inject Dynamic Prompt + Spec JSON",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Inject Dynamic Prompt + Spec JSON": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "POST Vapi /call/phone",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "POST Vapi /call/phone": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Check Vendor Line Busy / Error",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Check Vendor Line Busy / Error": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Log line_busy in MongoDB",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        []
      ]
    }
  }
}
